--- Core Python / Node ---

venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
node_modules/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

--- Logs & Databases ---

*.log
*.sqlite3
coverage.xml
nosetests.xml
*.coverage
htmlcov/
.cache/

--- Editor & IDE ---

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

--- OS Files ---

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

--- Documentation Build Artifacts ---

Ignore temporary outputs from doc generators

/docs/**/*.tmp
/docs/**/*.bak
/docs/**/*.swp
/docs/**/*.log

--- Governance Binder ---

Keep only Markdown files in binder, ignore temp exports

/docs/investor-presentations/**/*.pdf
/docs/investor-presentations/**/*.pptx
/docs/investor-presentations/**/*.docx

--- Repo Visuals ---

Allow diagrams in /docs but ignore raw design files

*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.xcf

 --- Misc ---

Ignore secrets or local env files

.env
.env.local
.env.*.backup
